==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Rubies are rare [[Material]]s occasionally obtained from breaking [[Ore Deposit]]s. They are also dropped by various types of [[Stone Talus]]es, Silver [[Enemy]] variants and [[Yiga Blademaster]]s when killed. They are sold at [[Ore and More]] in [[Tarrey Town]] and by [[Kairo]] at [[Foothill Stable]]. Rubies are said to contain the power of fire within them, granting warmth in colder temperatures when used in [[Armor]].<ref name="BotW Inventory"/>

[[Link]] can sell Rubies for 210 [[Rupee]]s in most [[Shop]]s, though the merchant [[Ramella]] will occasionally pay more for them in groups of 10 after completing the [[Side Quest]] "[[The Jewel Trade]]".<ref name="BotW Ramella"/> Rubies are required to purchase the [[Ruby Circlet]] from "[[Starlight Memories]]" Shop. Additionally, the description of the [[Snowquill Headdress]] reveals it is adorned with a Ruby.

